  {
    "hotel_id": "5547427",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/comfort-suites-tokyo-bay_5/hotel/tokyo-jp.html",
    "name": "Comfort Suites Tokyo Bay",
    "detail": "Our room is super cozy and spacious and is located inside the Tokyo Disney Resort area. I must say that this hotel was built the latest Japan technology room features and family friendly with its amenities and other services. If you’re touring the city of Tokyo, it’ll be a challenge for you because the hotel’s location is an hour and half or more away from all Tokyo top destination though it’s strategically located in the nearest bus stops that will take you to nearest train station that’ll will take you to different places around the city. On the other hand, if you’re only planning to just tour Odaiba, Maihama or Tokyo Disney resort, it’s much more easy because the hotel location is near and they provide free shuttle service to and from Disneyland. The hotel serves same menu on their complimentary breakfast but it’s not an issue for us because it tastes so good my tip is that try to mix and match the food if you’re staying for a week or you can try convenience store goodies which is located at the lobby of the hotel which is open 24hrs. The hotel is also self service but most of your needs are readily available at the lobby or in each floors. The staffs are accommodating and pleasant though they are having a hard time speaking in English, they’re trying their very best to communicate and serve their guests.",
    "area": "Tokyo Disney Resort,Tokyo - View on map",
    "rating": "8.8",
    "reviews": "2918 reviews",
